# Internal security audit of the Italy Taxi Service site.
#
# Deliberately not published. This repository is public, and that document
# names a live site's domain, admin address, CRM routes and lead-intake
# endpoint, and sets out weaknesses in it in enough detail to act on. It
# stays on disk; nothing in this codebase depends on it.
docs/lead-system-reference-audit.md

